&lt;p&gt;KKR’s Private Credit (PC) Operations is a global team that supports a broad range of operational functions across the asset management and insurance business segments. Comprised of over 30 professionals, we work closely with deal teams, legal, tax, finance, treasury, and other internal groups to manage various responsibilities related to both pre- and post-close activities. These activities span across KKR’s Direct Lending, Junior Debt, Transportation, Real Estate, and other strategic investment platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
