&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION SUMMARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Private Equity team are looking to hire an intern (6 months) to be based in Singapore. The intern will be involved in all aspects of the investment process across Private Equity investments including: sourcing and evaluating potential investments; performing due diligence; monitoring and implementing improvements at portfolio companies. The intern will interact closely with other KKR businesses such as the KKR Client Solutions team, KKR Capstone and KKR Capital Markets.&lt;/p&gt;
