&lt;li&gt;Lead, in-depth due diligence and business and financial modeling analyses on new investment opportunities and manage all aspects of the deal execution process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and lead the management of portfolio companies, actively support company operating and financial initiatives, and oversee value-creation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
