&lt;li&gt;An ideal candidate will have a genuine enthusiasm and curiosity for investing, is highly analytical, entrepreneurial professional with experience working on demanding, high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp; Investment experience across different industries is considered valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience analyzing and structuring investments using sophisticated research, analytical, quantitative and financial modeling/valuation skills is required. S/he will thrive in a merit-based environment functioning as a member of a highly collaborative, tight-knit team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S/he is expected to be able to operate independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past internship experience in private equity or investment banking will be advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
