&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about and openness to adopting emerging AI technologies in day-to-day workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to critically evaluate AI-generated outputs for accuracy and relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the expected annual base salary range for this San Francisco-based position. Actual salaries may vary based on factors, such as skill, experience, and qualification for the role. Employees may be eligible for a discretionary bonus, based on factors such as individual and team performance.&lt;/p&gt;
