&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation Support: Create test plans for product implementations on multiple platforms. Work on development and testing of system builds in support of product implementation efforts. Provide support for product training and create process documentation. Work with Legal/Compliance on the creation of required materials and with Sales and Marketing on product design and implementation process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Requirement Definition: Work with internal and external partners to create business requirement documentation, product specifications and product outlines for Global Atlantic products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract Drafting and Filing: Work with internal and external partners on Contract drafting and review.&amp;nbsp; Provide support throughout the filing process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Support: Work with impacted areas to identify, quantify, and resolve issues for inforce business on all platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
