&lt;li&gt;Identify, analyze, and correct data discrepancies to ensure data integrity on the existing portfolio and produce reports to monitor portfolio performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in designing standard operating procedures and requirements for supporting technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build out robust reporting to provide analytics and insights on the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze borrowing base calculations, concentration requirements, and hedging facilities across portfolios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
