&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e271953b767e&quot;&gt;Build the AI-powered data solutions layer, including unified Data Rooms that replace legacy data collections and provide governed access to structured data models and indexed document repositories.&lt;/p&gt;
