&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3185&quot; data-local-id=&quot;117d518dc3a0&quot;&gt;Drive BI consolidation and integration by establishing native Sigma and Power BI experiences within the Data Explorer inventory, supporting the retirement of the legacy report engine, and evaluating Sigma-based interactive exploration as an alternative to the existing &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;AG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Grid Data Access experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3489&quot; data-local-id=&quot;33aef6dce558&quot;&gt;Data distribution as part of the Unified Data Fabric team to consume governed Gold-layer data products and ensure that platform experiences align with enterprise data product, metadata, lineage, quality, and interoperability standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3728&quot; data-local-id=&quot;031545023c49&quot;&gt;Integrate Data Explorer with the firm’s persona and access-package entitlement model, working closely with ADAPT Engineering teams responsible for data fabric, MKS, Saviynt, and related platform capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3940&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ccd3f7e97e12&quot;&gt;Define reusable architecture and engineering patterns for APIs, authentication, authorization, data access, AI integration, observability, testing, deployment, and operational support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4128&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d10ecc25f88b&quot;&gt;Ensure that the platform meets enterprise expectations for security, reliability, performance, scalability, auditability, data classification, and regulatory controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4299&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7844bf4bc2cd&quot;&gt;Set the engineering bar through architecture reviews, technical standards, design documentation, code quality practices, and mentorship of senior engineers and technical leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4479&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2dfd4fcedd23&quot;&gt;Lead complex cross-team design decisions and resolve architectural issues that span application engineering, data engineering, AI, identity, BI, infrastructure, and operational workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4670&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ea649209944&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering, product, architecture, analytics, Data Operations, and business leaders to sequence investments, manage technical dependencies, and align delivery with the firm’s broader data and analytics strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4899&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b6114e8adf77&quot;&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and market developments in AI-powered analytics, agent platforms, data discovery, BI integration, identity, and enterprise data platforms, translating relevant developments into practical architectural recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Required&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f3c74d710325&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5168&quot;&gt;Required&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems, or a related technical field; advanced degree preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed4423a8-913f-470f-84ff-2a89ff236776&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5180&quot; data-local-id=&quot;443f9726f929&quot;&gt;Ten or more years of software engineering experience, with a demonstrated track record of owning architecture for user-facing data platforms, enterprise web applications, or similarly complex products at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5394&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c2a500342a1&quot;&gt;Expert full-stack engineering skills, including modern React and TypeScript front-end development and API or service-layer development over cloud-based data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5565&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cabc4ec7e6c7&quot;&gt;Strong experience designing and operating platforms using technologies such as Snowflake, lakehouse or Apache Iceberg architectures, and AWS services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5719&quot; data-local-id=&quot;52baa3e1a9b0&quot;&gt;Deep experience with enterprise identity and access management, including &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SSO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RBAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ABAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; entitlement models, identity governance integrations such as Saviynt, and secure external or client-facing access patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5939&quot; data-local-id=&quot;778e4d280f5f&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience delivering AI-powered product capabilities, such as LLM integration, retrieval over structured and unstructured data, natural-language query interfaces, AI-assisted document analysis, or enterprise agent platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6177&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5edb57a8b83&quot;&gt;Experience embedding or integrating business intelligence tools such as Sigma, Power BI, or Tableau into a unified product experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6315&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d3f9c011789&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL and Python, with the ability to work effectively across application, data, integration, and AI technology layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6458&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9f115999427c&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to design secure, scalable, reliable, and observable systems that support both internal users and external clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6598&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c067f3e371b5&quot;&gt;Proven technical leadership, including driving cross-team architecture decisions, establishing engineering standards, mentoring experienced engineers, and influencing outcomes without relying on direct authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6814&quot; data-local-id=&quot;165b123d9486&quot;&gt;Ability to operate at both strategic and hands-on technical levels, translating ambiguous requirements into durable platform capabilities and actionable engineering plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6989&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ac81c4b4b498&quot;&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to explain complex technical decisions to engineering, product, operations, architecture, and business audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
