&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9df40eaa-b20d-43b6-b13e-900e40f97680&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7192&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f88b9a1b8bac&quot;&gt;Experience in financial services or another highly regulated industry, including familiarity with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt;-aligned controls, auditability, data classification, and governed access to sensitive information.&lt;/p&gt;
