&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7396&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f6273851ff1f&quot;&gt;Experience with event-driven architectures and technologies such as Kafka.&lt;/p&gt;
