&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7474&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eaf1da896e20&quot;&gt;Familiarity with enterprise data products, data catalogs, data marketplaces, semantic layers, metadata management, lineage, and governed self-service data access.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7640&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d4b97d922ede&quot;&gt;Experience modernizing or consolidating enterprise BI and reporting ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
