&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A proactive, solutions-oriented mindset, including the ability to identify repetitive or manual processes that can be streamlined through AI, automation, or other technology-enabled solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
